# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
# Adjustfile — known, bounded repository drift

@abstract:
Tracks known limitations and their remediation boundary. This is an advisory
record; hard checks live in Mustfile.a2ml and CI.
@end

## Known Limitations

### legacy-per-app-config-format
- description: Per-app descriptors retain the .a2ml filename and TOML syntax while the estate migrates them to DEED
- severity: tracked
- owner: launch-scaffolder maintainers
- reference: hyperpolymath/standards#960

### linux-only-native-provisioning
- description: Native Rust desktop integration is currently Linux-only
- severity: tracked
- corrective: Add and test macOS and Windows backends before claiming native cross-platform provisioning

### placeholder-library-modules
- description: platform, integrity and exceptions modules are placeholders and are not used by the CLI
- severity: tracked
- corrective: Implement against normative standards before exposing as supported APIs
